    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Brain</strong> is a difficult top-down shooter where you hop between enemy bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862540/extras/a453075c417ae36d4a5a8cf82de9dffd.poster.avif?t=1755401373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862540/extras/a453075c417ae36d4a5a8cf82de9dffd.webm?t=1755401373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862540/extras/a453075c417ae36d4a5a8cf82de9dffd.mp4?t=1755401373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is quick and frequent, but levels are short and restarting is instant, letting you polish your skills without friction. Jumping bodies is fast and has no cooldown, so with sharp aim, you can blast through levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on an exoplanet. A technician wants to keep their job. A botanist wants to save their home. A cultist wants to end the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You help all of them; you are made to be helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things going. Make things worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun physics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus rhythm-based stages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that reinforces the themes of the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy defenestration! </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Brain</strong> is a difficult top-down shooter where you hop between enemy bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862540/extras/a453075c417ae36d4a5a8cf82de9dffd.poster.avif?t=1755401373\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862540/extras/a453075c417ae36d4a5a8cf82de9dffd.webm?t=1755401373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862540/extras/a453075c417ae36d4a5a8cf82de9dffd.mp4?t=1755401373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is quick and frequent, but levels are short and restarting is instant, letting you polish your skills without friction. Jumping bodies is fast and has no cooldown, so with sharp aim, you can blast through levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are on an exoplanet. A technician wants to keep their job. A botanist wants to save their home. A cultist wants to end the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You help all of them; you are made to be helpful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep things going. Make things worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun physics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrunning mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus rhythm-based stages!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that reinforces the themes of the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy defenestration! </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Bullet Brain is a top-down shooter where you jump between enemies in short, handcrafted levels. Bounce around in cueballs, eject old bodies out of windows, and ride grenades back to whoever shot them. Make things worse. Flood the pump. Spread the rot.",
